  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First public release of Enigma.Core: a DI-friendly, BouncyCastle-backed cryptography surface covering block & stream ciphers (ECB/CBC/CTR/GCM), RSA, post-quantum ML-DSA/ML-KEM, X.509 certificates, hashing, HMAC, OTP (HOTP/TOTP), key derivation (PBKDF2/Argon2), padding, and data encoding. Targets netstandard2.0/net8.0/net10.0. See RELEASENOTES.md for the full details.",
